                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "2D platformer in which you absorb enemy attacks to charge your own powers, overcome obstacles, and battle your evil double\n\n✅Unlocking new abilities\n✅Colorful visuals, a neon aesthetic, abstract shapes, and uniquely designed enemies\n✅The price is appropriate for the game\n✅Electronic music that complements the pace of the gameplay\n\n❌Repetitive gameplay,much of the time is spent positioning your character and using attacks to navigate the environment\n❌Before obtaining certain special items, dying forces you to restart the level from the beginning\n❌Lacks variety and innovative design choices\n❌Some stages rely on trial and error rather than gradually teaching the player the game's mechanics\n❌Many empty areas\n\n❌❌ Verdict: [strike] Terrible [/strike], [b] Bad [/b], [strike] Mediocre [/strike], [strike] Decent [/strike], [strike] Good [/strike], [strike] Very Good [/strike] (Rating scale for the game tested)\n\n[quote]If you'd like to see more of my reviews, you can find them on my\ncurator page:[url=https://store.steampowered.com/curator/45994324/admin/reviews_manage/]CuratorKingViking[/url]\nand in my group: [url=https://steamcommunity.com/groups/CuratorKingViking]GroupKingViking[/url]\n\nIf you have any questions about my reviews, feel free to ask. I'm happy to answer them. All reviews are my own!! Best regards, King Viking Bezimienny, Polish Game Reviewer. [/quote]",
